{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.24] Let's make love in the sunrise (Yeah)\n[00:15.90] Had enough hell in my life (Oh yeah)\n[00:17.68] Percs, purple lean, red moonlight (Yeah)\n[00:19.48] Did enough spells for one night (Yeah)\n[00:21.32] Help me run away from the drug life\n[00:22.64] I've been hiding pain with the Wraith and the limelight\n[00:24.60] Satan had a place in my heart, and it ain't right\n[00:26.32] Kick him to the curb for a girl from the white light\n[00:28.18] Demon horns, halo, that girl my type\n[00:29.92] She don't got it now, but she used to have a dark side\n[00:31.74] Bad dream, I woke up on the dark side\n[00:33.50] Nowadays, when I'm high, I get stuck in the dark side\n[00:35.20] She look me in my eyes, send me love from the light side\n[00:37.26] That's how I know that I'm gon' be alright\n[00:38.80] Demons in my chest, they pressed from the left side\n[00:40.82] Look at my demons, they pressed on the inside\n[Verse 1]\n[00:43.48] Uh, dilated, high and wasted on them blues, yeah, yeah\n[00:47.22] Mix it with that purple heroin and fossil fuels, yeah, yeah\n[00:50.86] That's when I'm a different person\n[00:52.72] At that point, I'm not a person\n[00:54.54] At that point, my tongue a serpent\n[00:56.34] Door's unlocked and third eye's open\n[00:58.14] Growl with it, uh\n[00:59.46] Fuck it, howl with it, uh\n[01:01.30] Get wild with it, huh\n[01:02.90] Then, crack a smile with it, uh\n[01:04.94] Do your wrong, look in the mirror like, \"Yeah, I did it\" (Oh yeah)\n[01:08.56] Drink that potion, red or purple\n[01:10.44] Throw your Perkies in a circle\n[01:12.34] Eyes started turning purple, codeine cup, it runneth over\n[01:15.82] Turning water into codeine, turning consciousness to comas\n[01:19.50] Now, the Devil standing over, yeah, he smiling and he lurking\n[01:23.34] He laughing 'cause them potions that you mixing up was working\n[Bridge]\n[01:27.28] Oh, now the third eye's closed\n[01:29.68] She pulled me ou